edits_description = "Only the boar and the ground were used."
final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_jg17w")
blurb = "Depicts a wild boar in front of a waterfall. This was likely part of a set of twelve zodiacal signs. Other known prints from this group are: Ox, Dog, Hare, Tiger, Monkey, and Horse.

The inscription is a poem:

[i][Like] a maiden's
flower-dyed robe's
swinging sleeve
unstitch
the cherry blossoms.[/i]

It is unclear how this related to the image."
